      "difficulty": "hard",
      "title": "Kuriame name?",
      "passage": "– Atsiprašau, kuriame name gyvena Petras?\n– Tame pačiame, kuriame ir aš. Šitas namas naujas, o anas, prie parduotuvės, senas. Petras gyvena šiame, trečiame aukšte.\n– Ačiū. Vakar skambinau, bet niekas neatsakė.\n– Vakar jo nebuvo. Jis kiekvieną šeštadienį važiuoja pas mamą ir grįžta tik sekmadienį.\n– Tokia tvarka? Tada ateisiu rytoj.\n– Ateikite. Bet visą rytą jo nebus — jis dirba iki pirmos.\n– Gerai. Tokio pat buto aš irgi ieškau — ne to seno, o šito.",
      "translation": "\"Excuse me, which house does Petras live in?\" — \"The same one I do. This house is new, and that one over there, by the shop, is old. Petras lives in this one, on the third floor.\" — \"Thank you. Yesterday I rang, but nobody answered.\" — \"He wasn't there yesterday. Every Saturday he goes to his mother's and doesn't come back until Sunday.\" — \"Is that the routine? Then I'll come tomorrow.\" — \"Do. But all morning he won't be in — he works until one.\" — \"Good. I am looking for the same sort of flat too — not that old one, but this one.\"",
